WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.301
What to carry forward.

2
00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:06.147
When an answer is wrong, find the stage that lost the truth before touching anything.

3
00:00:06.427 --> 00:00:13.083
Log traces that make that possible: ranks, cutoffs, final context, citations, verifier results.

4
00:00:13.363 --> 00:00:18.973
Make abstention a designed path with an exact phrase, a score gate, and two numbers you track.

5
00:00:19.253 --> 00:00:23.648
Route before you retrieve, with the cheapest model that measurably does the job.

6
00:00:23.928 --> 00:00:32.333
And for any corpus small enough to fit, test long context with caching as a baseline, because it deletes three failure categories at once.

7
00:00:32.613 --> 00:00:35.899
The last lesson puts these decisions into one design.
